        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Stewart, Graham Gouldman\n- Bands: 10cc\n- Albums: The Original Soundtrack, Relayted\n- Songs: Life Is a Minestrone\n\nFacts:\n- Eric Stewart and Graham Gouldman were members of the band 10cc.\n- In 1975, \"Life Is a Minestrone\" was a top-five single from 10cc's album \"The Original Soundtrack.\"\n- The album \"Relayted\" was inspired by a song from 10cc's 1975 album \"The Original Soundtrack.\"\n- \"Life Is a Minestrone\" was the other top-five single from 10cc's 1975 album \"The Original Soundtrack\" besides the song that inspired \"Relayted.\"",
